{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13394","headline":"宿岸道人精舍 · 阎防","name":"宿岸道人精舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早岁参道风，放情入寥廓。\n重因息心侣，遂果岩下诺。\n敛迹辞人间，杜门守寂寞。\n秋风翦兰蕙，霜气冷淙壑。\n山牖见然灯，竹房闻捣药。\n愿言舍尘事，所趣非龙蠖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}